  "content": "<p><strong>粒子雨</strong>将默认天气替换为更美观的粒子效果，并增添了额外的雾、风及沙尘暴天气特效。您甚至可以通过游戏内配置菜单添加或自定义天气效果。</p><p>Fabric版本需要<strong>Fabric API。</strong></p><p>如需<strong>配置</strong>，请使用指令<code>/particlerain</code>或您加载器的模组列表菜单</p><p>常见<strong>兼容性</strong>问题请查看<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain%252f%2523teleports\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0\" width=\"775\" height=\"450\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p><p>若内嵌视频无法播放，请直接访问：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%252fembed%252foan4xH5RvH0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0</a></span></p><h3>雨滴粒子</h3><p>以倾斜角度下落，仿佛被风吹拂。暴风雨天气时风力更强。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\"></p><h3>雪花粒子</h3><p>下落时缓慢旋转。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\"></p><h3>沙尘暴</h3><p>尘埃与灌木丛在沙漠及其他干燥生物群系中飞扬。支持模组添加的生物群系。粒子颜色会匹配下方方块的颜色。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\"></p><h3>生物群系着色</h3><p>雨水和水粒子会匹配生物群系的水体色调。在原版生物群系中，着色效果不会如此明显。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\"></p><h3>水面涟漪</h3><p>雨滴落入水中时出现。会匹配您资源包的分辨率。（可配置）</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\"></p><h3>水痕</h3><p>雨滴击中坚硬材质墙面时出现。（可配置为在任何方块上显示）</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\"></p><h3>薄雾</h3><p>降雨后，渗入地面的水分会蒸发回空气中，在地表形成薄雾云团。这些雾也会自然出现在标有`#c:is_spooky`和`#c:is_wet/`标签的生物群系中（此功能同样可配置）</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\"></p><h3>配置与自定义效果</h3><p>您可以通过内置配置菜单为特定方块和生物群系创建各类环境粒子效果，或编辑现有效果。</p><p>通过指令`/particlerain`或模组菜单访问配置界面。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\"></p><h3><del>水洼</del></h3><p><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puddles-floods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">水洼功能已重构并作为独立模组发布。</span></a></em></p><h2>其他链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/particle-rain/issues?q=is:issue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">问题追踪</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpigc.art%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Discord社区</span></a></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/particle-rain/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更新日志/版本说明</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">备用镜像下载</span></a></li>\n</ul>",
